---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <h2>Controller</h2>
    <p>Stephan Orth, Perchtoldsdorfer Straße 7/6, 1230 Vienna, Austria. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>This website is hosted by GitHub Pages, a service of GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA. When you visit the site, GitHub processes technical data such as your IP address, browser type and time of access in server log files. This is necessary to deliver the website securely (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Data may be transferred to the USA; GitHub relies on the EU Standard Contractual Clauses and the EU-US Data Privacy Framework. More information: <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.</p>
    <h2>Fonts</h2>
    <p>All fonts are hosted on this server. No connection to Google or other font providers is made.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This website uses no cookies.</p>
    <h2>Visitor statistics (GoatCounter)</h2>
    <p>To see which pages are read, this site uses GoatCounter, a privacy-friendly analytics service (<a href="https://www.goatcounter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">goatcounter.com</a>). When you open a page, a small script sends the page address, the referring website, browser type, screen size and approximate country to GoatCounter. No cookies are set and nothing is stored on your device. Your IP address is not stored. To count unique visits, GoatCounter keeps a hash of the IP address, browser identifier and a random value in memory for up to 8 hours; it is never written to disk. Statistics are stored only in aggregated form. The legal basis is my legitimate interest in understanding how the site is used (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). More information: <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GoatCounter Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>Prediction game</h2>
    <p>Some articles include a prediction game. If you take part, the coach name you enter and your picks are stored, together with the time of your entry. Your IP address is not stored. Before kick-off, only the share of picks per answer is shown; after kick-off, your coach name and your picks are shown publicly next to the game. Participation is voluntary; by submitting a call you consent to this (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). You can withdraw your consent and have your entry deleted at any time by email. Entries are deleted after the end of the season.</p>
    <p>The game runs on Cloudflare Workers and Cloudflare D1, services of Cloudflare, Inc., 101 Townsend St, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA. Cloudflare processes technical data such as your IP address to deliver the service. Data may be transferred to the USA; Cloudflare relies on the EU Standard Contractual Clauses and the EU-US Data Privacy Framework. More information: <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>If you contact me by email, I use your details only to answer your request (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR) and delete them when they are no longer needed.</p>
    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>This site links to Instagram and YouTube. These services only process data once you click a link and leave this site.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection. You can also lodge a complaint with the Austrian Data Protection Authority (Datenschutzbehörde, dsb.gv.at).</p>
  </div>
</Base>
